{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03360",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.23,
      "end_seconds": 3.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Hi, sit anywhere you like."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.81,
      "end_seconds": 5.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Hi, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.49,
      "end_seconds": 9.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "So what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.41,
      "end_seconds": 19.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got pain in my breastbone wound."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.61,
      "end_seconds": 29.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.78,
      "end_seconds": 35.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "I was on clopidogrel before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.14,
      "end_seconds": 46.85,
      "duration_seconds": 10.71,
      "text": "Right, right. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.39,
      "end_seconds": 56.51,
      "duration_seconds": 9.12,
      "text": "A eight out of ten, I suppose. I'd say once or twice a day. I've also had swollen ankles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.97,
      "end_seconds": 62.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.61,
      "end_seconds": 83.04,
      "duration_seconds": 19.43,
      "text": "It happens on and off. It's severe, honestly. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. I told my wife I'd come today. I've had a clicking in the breastbone too, for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.9,
      "end_seconds": 89.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "And what about fever, chest pain on exertion or breathlessness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.94,
      "end_seconds": 96.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "I haven't had fever, chest pain on exertion or breathlessness, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.46,
      "end_seconds": 101.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.59,
      "end_seconds": 105.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.65,
      "end_seconds": 108.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.68,
      "end_seconds": 112.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.87,
      "end_seconds": 117.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.5,
      "end_seconds": 122.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "I have heart disease, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.08,
      "end_seconds": 127.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Sure. Alright, heart disease, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.3,
      "end_seconds": 140.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.94,
      "end_seconds": 148.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.3,
      "end_seconds": 152.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Okay, have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.12,
      "end_seconds": 158.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.14,
      "end_seconds": 161.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.31,
      "end_seconds": 165.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.37,
      "end_seconds": 168.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.64,
      "end_seconds": 178.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.33,
      "end_seconds": 203.48,
      "duration_seconds": 8.15,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.7 degrees, saturation 99 percent, BP is 121 over 69, pulse 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.0,
      "end_seconds": 209.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.91,
      "end_seconds": 225.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.48,
      "end_seconds": 227.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.4,
      "end_seconds": 246.67,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "The chest wound has healed, the breastbone is stable, and the vein-harvest wound on the leg is a little swollen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.01,
      "end_seconds": 249.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.33,
      "end_seconds": 256.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.42,
      "end_seconds": 275.73,
      "duration_seconds": 10.31,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like recovering well after bypass surgery. I'd also keep a leg wound infection in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.2,
      "end_seconds": 280.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.99,
      "end_seconds": 295.57,
      "duration_seconds": 12.58,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now recovering well after bypass surgery is my leading thought, not anything worse. I'd like to arrange an ECG for post-operative review."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.31,
      "end_seconds": 304.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.15,
      "end_seconds": 308.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.29,
      "end_seconds": 313.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.26,
      "end_seconds": 315.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}